<title>USA: Lindsey to step down as Fed Governor - Journal.</title>
<headline>Lindsey to step down as Fed Governor - Journal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve Governor Lawrence Lindsey told the White House Thursday that he is resigning after five years on the seven-seat board, The Wall Street Journal reported Friday.</p>
<p>There will soon be two openings on the Fed, as Janet Yellen is also quitting to become President Clinton's top economist.</p>
</text>
